grated_image.png", "id": "576345286298093", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162791_194200944514699_6976310366665965568_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qjU-zeDvD7QQ7kNvwFZXwqX&_nc_oc=AdkrQ-JE2dbQKNWD51-tD0ya5lGpLIJ0Q9oH1oDvdnf2ph8n4ofFMAnLEQ9On1XbGOU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfscAVoUTKaZIZO9ezPhGipHsVAcG61KZU_GxQ371NM39g&oe=699EE29C"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "840229886440289", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386401_178839952894596_7973465854262116352_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2P2VXUPg9X0Q7kNvwGH7ghH&_nc_oc=Adm-y6kxll0_zN9jVHme16kEKCeVeH4OKV7iqdZYX-vHHR0X2D1omE_gMlPQQWB1uQI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfulesfL39dA6Stnk9aceKBSoB2Zg19xx6X9Oo7hJ8bEjQ&oe=699EFE75"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "240985190371600", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/10000000_191517794790710_819105329122902016_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fdpuGR1Ys2IQ7kNvwFqDVnx&_nc_oc=Adn0Yz-FusAYze_GH37_g0ehNJqtk7iiaI-nNpEx9ah7ba0goD2nQBAXW5A2C0PE8Gw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftAORRS7tSaHnII-SQvGMomVGuiQH-yK6zUbGeX5yP9pA&oe=699ED857"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "202715584292613", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12139031_863197173880556_8309859727383199744_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wCDVQ324NIgQ7kNvwGr3wI6&_nc_oc=AdlZnXr4mZVyTnaJkqb78eDXOelz-APAfoCpFafFgEdSlPmzzdJJbva-jw2Yq1kmtTY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsU5Pk2f59x7q0FoTAWPG0GiqOB1D_qs6Z3z7IPR-CFQQ&oe=699F0649"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2643834889078100", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12448944_162446487752374_4171312266970398720_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kbGm18yaiUMQ7kNvwEErtj5&_nc_oc=AdkzhlL25nwjJhO20p-wLjZmlFdF0FcO-XFMMu6I90lPLRGLdIX8mjwEaUJUQd3YgQs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuqZpJYt1ALjVwtVimpOrYv8GclFBUMUuC-taOn3t4kdg&oe=699F0230"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Discovering Space", "keywords": ["space", "exploration", "simulation", "solar", "explore"], "long_description": "* Learn the about some of our close neighbours, through an intensely engaging experience.\n\n* Contemplate the awesomeness and remoteness of space.\n\n\u2026 or just simply enjoy the ride.\n\n\nHighlights:\n\nTake a high orbit around the earth, visit the far side of the Moon. Fly in close to Moon\u2019s surface and understand the formation of lunar features.\n\nSee our fragile home, Earth, from a completely new perspective.\n\nVisit Mars and its companion moons. Fly in low and close over some of Mars\u2019 ancient geological features.\n\nGo deeper into the Solar system; graze upon Jupiter\u2019s swirling clouds and swing around some of its fascinating moons.\n\n\nFeatures:\n\n* High quality 3d real-time rendered visuals for truly immersive feel.\n* True to scale planets and moons.\n* Engaging soundtrack and audio.\n* Three tours, between 5 and 10 minutes each.", "short_description": "A breath-taking space discovery experience through a series of guided and narrated tours."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/eula/", "publisher_name": "DiscoveringVR", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://discoveringvr.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EDUCATIONAL", "EXPLORATION", "SPACE_UNIVERSE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_lang